WEBVTT

00:08:27.092 --> 00:08:30.394
Hiyo ni sehemu ndogo tu
katika mpango wa INSPIRE.

00:08:30.418 --> 00:08:33.735
Lakini nchi nyingi zaidi zimekubali
kuutekeleza,

00:08:33.759 --> 00:08:35.013
kuufanya uwe wa ndani,

00:08:35.037 --> 00:08:37.672
kuujaziliza kwa taarifa za wakati,
na kuweka mpango pamoja,

00:08:37.696 --> 00:08:39.133
kufanya kazi kati ya vitengo,

00:08:39.157 --> 00:08:41.133
na kuanza ile safari ya kutokomeza.

00:08:41.157 --> 00:08:44.982
Canada, Mexico, 
Jamuhuri ya Kiarabu, Tanzania --

00:08:45.006 --> 00:08:46.923
Nilishazitaja Sweden na Uganda --

00:08:46.947 --> 00:08:48.879
Japan, Uphilipino, Indonesia,

00:08:48.903 --> 00:08:51.514
nchi nyingi zaidi,
na sana miji, pia.

00:08:51.538 --> 00:08:53.903
Na hapa tulipo Scotland,

00:08:53.927 --> 00:08:56.942
Chuo cha Edinburgh
kinatengeneza maabara ya kujifunzia

00:08:56.966 --> 00:09:00.268
ambayo itaenda kufuatilia safari
kuwa miji ya Scotland